            "text": "\n- Multi-canvas Excalidraw projects with hierarchical tree organization\n\n- Internal drawing links with element-specific navigation and auto-scroll\n\n- Drag & drop tree reorganization with circular reference prevention\n\n- Tree search (Cmd+K), content search, and global full-text search (Cmd+Shift+F)\n\n- Interactive graph view (Cmd+G) with 5 layouts, auto-updates, and smooth transitions\n\n- Dark/Light mode with theme persistence\n\n\n",
